WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:24.494
Kirish: Har bir bazaning o‘z dunyosi

00:24.494 --> 00:46.379
MySQL: DATETIME va TIMESTAMP farqi

00:46.379 --> 01:20.267
MySQL dagi 3 ta xavfli tuzoq

01:20.267 --> 01:47.341
SQLite: Maxsus tip yo‘q, 3 ta saqlash klassi

01:47.341 --> 02:23.086
SQLite dagi g‘aroyib holatlar va matn tuzog‘i

02:23.086 --> 02:53.880
Taqqoslash jadvali va yakuniy xulosalar
